@establishment-types-data-public
Feature: Display establishment data to public users
 As a public user
 I want to view type specific details for establishments
 So that I can understand the characteristics, provision and capacity of an establishment before engaging with it

@establishment-types-data-public-28-Academy-sponsor-led
Scenario: Public data displayed for 28 Academy sponsor led
Given a public user has requested information about an establishment
When the establishment type of the viewed establishment is 28 Academy sponsor led
Then the following fields are returned, in the order shown:
Establishment name
URN
UKPRN
Establishment status
Open date
Closed date
Reason establishment closed
Reason establishment opened
Establishment type
Education phase
Gender of entry
Diocese
Religious character
Religious ethos
Number of pupils
Number of pupils eligible for free school meals
Nursery provision
School capacity
Headteacher or principal
Boarding provision
Section 41 approved
Special classes
Type of resourced provision
Telephone number

